Cheers,
Armored Souls Team


[h2]Changelog v0.1.7[/h2]

[h3]Adds: [/h3]
[list]
[*] Allowed for mods to be more than one slot in size;
[*] Added Forge (locked) in Main Menu;
[*] Added a “Confirm?” pop-up when pressing “New Game” if a save already exists;
[*] Improved Smelter Saw rocket sound variety;
[*] Added SFX to Smelter Saw flurry rock attack;
[*] Added Size logic and stat to existing mods;
[*] Added new mods: Permadeath Remover, Default Core, Conqueror’s Red;
[*] Added new dual-stat mods: Tainted Reactor, Restless Recharge, Rapid Tap, Overreach, Bulk Up;
[*] Additional warning in circuit UI for self-damaging mods (like Overclock);
[*] Permadeath (disabled by equipping the “Permadeath Remover);
[*] Various UI / UX improvements;
[*] Scaling difficulty up to Mk-10;
[/list]
[h3]Changes: [/h3]
[list]
[*] Changed intro message;
[*] Changed the way mods appear when picked up and swapped in Motherboard;
[*] Changed the mod menu column order;
[*] Changed Player starting motherboard preset;
[*] Changed the color of augments in the Motherboard to white to improve readability;
[*] Remade Plasma Gun (1x1 slots) into Plasma Cannon (2x1 slots);
[*] Removed “Max HP +” and “Max EN +” mods;
[*] Renamed “Max HP %” and “Max En %”, respectively, in “Heath” and “Energy”;
[*] Changed mods order and priority in menus;
[*] Removed grace time from Dash as it was not properly working;
[*] Changed mod color on non-active mods to improve readability;
[*] Changed circuit color on non-active circuits to improve readability;
[*] Changed Smelter Saw loot to include new mods;
[*] Changed circuit outline to dashed lines when there are no Weapon/Motion/Tool attached;
[*] Upgraded project to Unity 2022.3.47f1
[/list]
[h3]Balancing:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Reduced Plasma Cannon base damage (5 → 3);
[*] Limit Break now reduces duration by 50% instead of increasing it (+300% → -50%);
[*] EN Recovery values converted from flat to percent in Overclock and EN Recovery Chip;
[*] Increased EN Recovery values for Overclock (30% -> 40%);
[/list]
[h3]Fixes:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed augments variations influencing other circuits;
[*] Fixed issue where stats reaching zero disappeared in UI;
[*] Fixed Smelter Saw rockets’ behavior and sound issues;
[*] Fixed Limit Break breaking circuits with less than 1 Energy;
[*] Fixed Discord link in Main Menu;
[*] Renamed “EN Reduction” into “EN Cost (Permanent)” for clarity; 
[*] Fixed non-updating descriptions when swapping mods;
[*] Fixed Autoaim bug with multiple enemies;
[*] Fixed UI issue with duplicate legs in Motherboard;
[*] Fixed bug with pause menu breaking Teleport pop-up;
[*] Various improvements to text descriptions;
[*] Various graphical fixes;
[/list]
